e, but one pretty simple one is =0Athat US securities rules generally don=
=E2=80=99t let retail investors pay 2-and-20 fees.=0AUS law <https://bloom.=
bg/4rLrPO7> generally prohibits registered fund managers =0Afrom charging p=
