s people as a problem: Fancy institutions and rich people can own the =0Ago=
od cool private companies, but ordinary investors can=E2=80=99t.=0A=0AIf yo=
u think this is a problem =E2=80=94 and the SEC does =E2=80=94 how do you f=
ix it=3F There =0Aare about three possible approaches. One is to try to get=
 more of the good cool =0Acompanies to go public. For instance, change the =
