=E2=80=9CMake IPOs Great =0AAgain=E2=80=9D isthe slogan <https://bloom.bg/4=
ANiTvS> for this approach.=0A=0AAnother approach, conversely, is just to le=
t regular retail investors invest =0Ain private companies. The SEC is worki=
