id of the US=E2=80=99s =0Asecurities disclosure rules <https://bloom.bg/4AO=
Lnp4>, which have largely =0Aworked well for almost a century. Plus regular=
 investors couldn=E2=80=99t actually buy=0Aanyprivate stocks they want: May=
be the best private companies would raise large =0Achecks from the best ins=
titutional investors, the worst private companies would =0Araise small chec=
ks from dentists, andretail would be adversely selected =0A<https://bloom.b=
g/4rHrhZn>.=0A=0AThe third approach, and the main focus of yesterday=E2=80=
=99s proposals, is to make it =0Aeasier for individual investors to invest =
in private markets throughfunds. =0APrivate markets would still be open mos=
