=0Ayou have money in a mutual fund, you can take it out with one day=E2=80=
=99s notice. =0AThis is pretty easy for the mutual fund to handle: If you t=
ake your money out, =0Ait can sell some stock to pay you. It=E2=80=99s hard=
er, though, for a private equity =0Afund. The SEChas rules <https://bloom.b=
g/3OPpQJ9> for =E2=80=9Cinterval funds,=E2=80=9D public =0Afunds that inves=
