e companies if they go in with their eyes wide open about the =0Arisk.=0A=
=0AWhat does =E2=80=9Cgo in with their eyes wide open=E2=80=9D mean, though=
, in practice=3F I have, =0Alike, seven-eighths-seriouslyproposed my own no=
n-financial test for investor =0Aaccreditation <https://bloom.bg/4hlLDEe>. =
In my version, if you want to buy =0Aweird private stuff of any kind, =E2=
=80=9Cyou just have to go to the local office of =0Athe SEC and get a Certi=
ficate of Dumb Investment=E2=80=9D:=0A=0ATo get that certificate, you sign =
