meone sells you a dumb weird private investment without checking your =0Ace=
rtificate first, they go to jail. But if you get the certificate and then b=
uy =0Athe dumb weird investment and it goes to zero, and youcomplain, you g=
o to jail. =0ACaveat extremely emptor!=0A=0AIt is safe to say that nobody a=
