ss a test of your investing knowledge and acumen, and then you can =0Abuy t=
he dumbest stuff imaginable, but you won=E2=80=99t, will you, because you=
=E2=80=99re so =0Asmart. Right=3FI once wrote <https://bloom.bg/3TjXMAp>:=
=0A=0AThe essential point about the Certificate of Dumb Investment is that =
it is not =0Aaspirational. It=E2=80=99s not that you go to the SEC and take=
 a test and get 100% on =0Athe test and they=E2=80=99re like =E2=80=9Ccongr=
atulations you=E2=80=99re so smart=E2=80=9D and you are like =E2=80=9CI =0A=
know right=E2=80=9D and they give you the Certificate of Being a Smart Inve=
