=80=9CSMART INVESTOR=E2=80=9D and =0Ayou walk out of the SEC office wearing=
 that button and you are absolutelymobbed =0Aby people selling structured n=
otes. People selling financial productslove =0Ainvestors who think they are=
 sophisticated.=0A=0AAnyway yesterday=E2=80=99s SEC announcement <https://b=
loom.bg/3W1Zl6I> also includes a =0ACertificate of Smart Investment:=0A=0AT=
he Commission separately seeks comment on the potential designation of the =
=0Apassage of an accredited investor exam to be developed by the Financial =
