ors to =0Abe accredited investors. An exam would provide a non-financial pa=
thway for =0Ainvestors to demonstrate their sophistication in the areas of =
securities, =0Ainvesting, and financial and business matters to appropriate=
ly evaluate the =0Amerits and risks of a prospective investment.=0A=0AHere =
